Package: apt-exporter
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Martin Norrsken <martin.norrsken@gmail.com>
Depends: apt
Description: Prometheus exporter for APT package upgrade metrics
 Exposes pending package upgrades, per-package details, and reboot-required
 status as Prometheus metrics via HTTP. Caches APT data in memory and
 refreshes via inotify, an optional APT post-invoke hook, and a periodic
 timer so scrapes never block on apt-get.
Homepage: https://github.com/mnorrsken/apt_exporter
